    "heading": "Climber's Kit (25 GP)",
    "lineStart": 6618,
    "lineEnd": 6620
  },
  "section": "6.85",
  "rulesText": "A Climber's Kit includes boot tips, gloves, pitons, and a harness. As a Utilize action, you can use the Climber's Kit to anchor yourself; when you do, you can't fall more than 25 feet from the anchor point, and you can't move more than 25 feet from there without undoing the anchor as a Bonus Action."
}
